WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs extended, hands behind the hips, fingers pointing toward the feet.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press into the hands and feet, lift the hips toward the sky.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Point the toes, squeeze the thighs, and open the chest.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the neck neutral or gently tip the head back if comfortable.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower the hips with control and shake out the wrists.
